# Pass "avec-vef": the mods the Forage.xml complement acts on. Forage.xml is guarded by
# PatchOperationFindMod "Vanilla Expanded Framework", so VEF is what switches it on; the other three
# are the animal mods whose defs its entries target, and Animals Forage (Continued) is the mod it
# complements. None of them is a dependency of this mod and none may become one.
#
# Prerequisites come before their consumers (VEF, then the mods that require it). The staging does not
# resolve the dependencies of a mod named here: VEF's own hard dependency (Harmony) is already in every
# pass.
#
